<title>USA: USDA releases $50 Mln in export credits to Egypt.</title>
<headline>USDA releases $50 Mln in export credits to Egypt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said it released $50 million in export credit guarantees for sale of ag exports to Egypt in fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>With the release, $150 million in short-term GSM-102 credits had been made available to exporters. USDA said $50 million remained to be allocated later.</p>
<p>No change was made in commodities eligible for the credits or terms for their use.</p>
</text>
